# statfiles - sample .dta files as base64, for the dta overlay. Written by
# pyreadstat 1.3.8 and pandas, or built by hand from StataCorp's format
# descriptions; every value was checked against pandas.read_stata. Do not edit.

# format 104 (hand-built from the 105 spec, LE): every type, old value labels, old double missing 2^333
